<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0532_T11PC0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What Johto’s Trap Houses like?\r...Oh. So they ain’t that different.\rThen I’ll get my homie in Johto to\ncatch a MARILL and trade it.\fLong-distance homie.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0532_T11PC0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I just came through Rock Tunnel. There\nwas some DRAMA at the Power Plant.\fAnd a dude in black runnin’ with a\npart.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0532_T11PC0101_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Adventures ain’t always oceans and\nmountains!\rDaily life can be a adventure too!\nLike findin’ parkin’ in Saffron.\r...By the way, I heard people talkin’\nabout a cave in Cerulean. You know\fanythin’?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0532_T11PC0101_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Silph Co.’s head office and the Magnet\nTrain station--that’s what you gotta\fsee\fin Saffron. The rest is traffic.</language>
	</row>
</body>
